      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1268410854,
      "text": "Juglans sigillata, common name iron walnut, is a species of tree in the walnut family Juglandaceae native to the eastern Himalayas and western China. The tree has been cultivated for its edible walnuts, and there have been at least 80 authorised or approved cultivars produced after successful implementation of grafting technology."
    },
    "fr": {
